#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1
msgid "YAML Configuration Syntax"
msgstr "YAML配置语法"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:3
msgid ""
"The configuration file is a YAML file to initialize the environment. It "
"contains the configuration parameters to simulate and visualize the "
"world, obstacle, and robot. You can customize the scenario and define the"
" behavior of the objects simply by using the parameters."
msgstr "配置文件是用于初始化环境的 YAML 文件。它包含用于模拟和可视化世界、障碍物和机器人的配置参数。你只需通过这些参数即可自定义场景并定义对象的行为。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:7
msgid "Configuration Overview"
msgstr "配置总览"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:9
msgid ""
"A complete IR-SIM scene is described by up to five top-level keys: "
"`world`, `robot`, `obstacle`, `gui`, and `custom`. **`robot` and "
"`obstacle` accept the same per-object keys**, while factory defaults can "
"differ by object type and kinematics, such as `role`, color, state "
"dimension, and image description. Expand the interactive tree below to "
"explore every key with its type and default; every key is optional unless"
" its default is `unset`. Click a section's **full docs ›** link to jump "
"to the detailed description."
msgstr ""
"一个完整的 IR-SIM 场景由最多五个顶层键描述 —— `world`、`robot`、`obstacle`、`gui` 和 "
"`custom`。**`robot` 和 `obstacle` 接受相同的对象级键**，但工厂默认值会因对象类型和运动学而异，例如 "
"`role`、颜色、状态维度和图像描述。展开下方的交互式树即可浏览每个键及其类型和默认值；除非默认值为 "
"`unset`，否则所有键均为可选。点击各部分的 **full docs ›** 链接可跳转到详细说明。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:11
msgid ""
"In a combined configuration for multiple simulators, these keys may be "
"nested under an optional top-level `irsim` mapping. IR-SIM reads and "
"validates that mapping while leaving sibling simulator sections "
"untouched. The filename passed to `irsim.make()` and used by "
"`env.reload()` does not change."
msgstr ""
"在多模拟器的组合配置中，这些键可以嵌套在可选的顶层 `irsim` 映射下。IR-SIM "
"读取并验证该映射，同时保持同级的其他模拟器部分不变。传递给 `irsim.make()` 并由 `env.reload()` "
"使用的文件名无需改变。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:460
msgid ""
"This tree is a quick map: click any key to jump to its full description. "
"For prose, examples, and edge cases, see the per-section docs below."
msgstr "该树是一个快速导览 —— 点击任意键即可跳转到它的完整说明。完整的说明、示例和边界情况请参见下方各部分的文档。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:465
msgid "Quick Start Example"
msgstr "快速上手示例"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:467
msgid ""
"The configuration file is divided into three main sections: `world`, "
"`robot`, and `obstacle`. Here's a minimal working example you can copy "
"and adapt:"
msgstr "配置文件主要分为三个部分：`world`、`robot` 和 `obstacle`。下面是一个可直接复制并修改的最小可用示例："

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md
msgid "Basic Configuration"
msgstr "基础配置"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:516
msgid "**Key Configuration Guidelines:**"
msgstr "**关键内容配置指南**"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:518
msgid ""
"To include several robots or obstacles in the configuration file, add "
"separate entries under the robot and obstacle sections using `-` for each"
" additional item."
msgstr "要在配置文件中包含多个机器人或障碍物，请在 robot 和 obstacle 部分下添加单独的条目，并使用 `-` 标记每个添加的条目。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:519
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Parameters such as distribution, shape, behavior, group_behavior, and "
"kinematics must be formatted as `{key: value}` pairs. Ensure that each "
"dictionary includes the `name` key; omitting name will result in a None "
"value for that parameter."
msgstr ""
"distribution、shape、behavior、group_behavior 和 kinematics 等参数必须写成 `{key: "
"value}` 字典形式。请确保每个字典都包含 `name` 键；省略 name 会使该参数取值为 None。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:520
msgid ""
"When dealing with multiple objects (i.e., when the number is greater than"
" 1), utilize the `distribution` parameter to define how these objects are"
" distributed."
msgstr "当处理多个对象（即数量大于 1）时，利用 `distribution` 参数来定义这些对象的摆放位置的分布方式。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:521
msgid ""
"By default, all objects within the same group share identical "
"configurations. To customize individual objects within a group, add sub-"
"parameters using `-`. Any additional objects not explicitly configured "
"will inherit the settings of the last specified object in the group."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，同一组内的所有对象共享相同的配置。要单独自定义组内的某个对象，可使用 `-` "
"添加子参数。未显式配置的其余对象会继承组中最后一个已指定对象的设置。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:522
msgid ""
"Object-level `name` is optional and identifies each object. If omitted, "
"it defaults to `\"<role>_<id>\"` (e.g., `robot_0`, `obstacle_3`). Names "
"must be unique across all objects; duplicates raise an error during "
"environment initialization. Do not confuse object-level `name` with the "
"`name` keys used inside dictionaries like `shape`, `kinematics`, or "
"`behavior` (which indicate component types)."
msgstr ""
"对象级 `name` 是可选的，用于标识每个对象。若省略，默认值为 `\"<role>_<id>\"`（例如 "
"`robot_0`、`obstacle_3`）。名称在所有对象间必须唯一；重复会在环境初始化时报错。请勿将对象级 `name` 与 "
"`shape`、`kinematics`、`behavior` 等字典内部的 `name` 键混淆（后者表示组件类型）。"

