#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md
msgid "**world properties**"
msgstr "**world 属性**"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:559
msgid "**`name`** (`str`, default: `\"world\"`)"
msgstr "**`name`**（`str`，默认： `\"world\"`）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:560
msgid ""
"Defines the name of the world used in the simulation. This can be useful "
"for identifying different simulation environments."
msgstr "定义仿真使用的世界名称，便于区分不同环境。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:563
msgid "**`height`** (`float`, default: `10`)"
msgstr "**`height`**（`float`，默认 `10`）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:564
msgid ""
"Specifies the vertical size of the world in units of meters in the Y-axis"
" direction plotted on the screen."
msgstr "指定世界在屏幕 Y 轴方向的垂直尺寸（米）。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:567
msgid "**`width`** (`float`, default: `10`)"
msgstr "**`width`**（`float`，默认 `10`）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:568
msgid ""
"Specifies the horizontal size of the world in units of meters in the "
"X-axis direction plotted on the screen."
msgstr "指定世界在屏幕 X 轴方向的水平尺寸（米）。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:571
msgid "**`step_time`** (`float`, default: `0.1`)"
msgstr "**`step_time`**（`float`，默认 `0.1`）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:572
msgid "Determines the time interval between each simulation step."
msgstr "决定仿真每一步之间的时间间隔。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:574
msgid ""
"**Performance Impact**: A smaller `step_time` results in a higher "
"simulation frequency (e.g., `0.1` seconds corresponds to 10 Hz) but needs"
" longer time to run the simulation."
msgstr "**性能影响**：`step_time` 越小仿真频率越高（如 0.1 秒即 10 Hz），但仿真耗时也更长。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:577
msgid "**`sample_time`** (`float`, default: `step_time`)"
msgstr "**`sample_time`**（`float`，默认与 `step_time` 相同）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:578
msgid ""
"Defines the time interval for rendering the simulation and extracting "
"data. This controls how frequently visual updates and data recordings "
"occur. If not specified, defaults to the value of `step_time`. The ratio "
"to `step_time` is truncated to a whole number of steps (at least one)."
msgstr ""
"定义渲染与数据采集的时间间隔，决定可视化更新与记录的频率。未指定时默认等于 `step_time`；与 `step_time` "
"的比值会向下取整为整数步数（至少为 1）。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:581
msgid "**`offset`** (`list` of `float`, default: `[0, 0]`)"
msgstr "**`offset`**（`float` 列表，默认 `[0, 0]`）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:582
msgid ""
"Sets the initial positional offset of the world on the X and Y axes. This"
" is useful for positioning the world within a larger coordinate system or"
" for relative placement."
msgstr "设置世界在 X、Y 轴上的初始偏移，便于在更大坐标系中定位或相对放置。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md
msgid "**world mode**"
msgstr "**world 模式**"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:589
msgid "**`step_mode`** (`str`, default: `\"internal\"`)"
msgstr "**`step_mode`**（`str`，默认：`\"internal\"`）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:590
msgid "Defines who advances object states during `env.step()`:"
msgstr "定义在 `env.step()` 期间由谁推进对象状态："

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:592
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:602
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:610
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:799
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1157
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1198
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1338
msgid "**Options:**"
msgstr "**选项:**"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:593
msgid ""
"`internal`: IR-SIM advances states through its kinematics using explicit "
"actions, keyboard commands, group behaviors, or object behaviors."
msgstr "`internal`：IR-SIM 使用显式动作、键盘命令、群组行为或对象行为，通过自身运动学推进状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:594
msgid ""
"`external`: An external system owns the state update. Set each object's "
"state and velocity with `set_state()` and `set_velocity()`, then call "
"`env.step()` without an action. IR-SIM synchronizes geometry and sensors,"
" rebuilds collision data, updates status, and advances the world clock "
"without running its kinematics or behaviors."
msgstr ""
"`external`：由外部系统负责更新状态。使用 `set_state()` 和 `set_velocity()` "
"设置每个对象的状态和速度，然后调用不带动作的 `env.step()`。IR-SIM "
"会同步几何信息和传感器、重建碰撞数据、更新状态并推进世界时钟，但不运行自身的运动学或行为逻辑。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:596
msgid ""
"`irsim.make(\"world.yaml\", step_mode=\"...\")` can override the YAML "
"value for a particular run. The override remains active across "
"`env.reload()` and `env.reset(random=True)`."
msgstr ""
"`irsim.make(\"world.yaml\", step_mode=\"...\")` 可以为特定运行覆盖 YAML 中的值；该覆盖在 "
"`env.reload()` 和 `env.reset(random=True)` 后仍然有效。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:599
msgid "**`control_mode`** (`str`, default: `\"auto\"`)"
msgstr "**`control_mode`** (`str`, 默认： `\"auto\"`)"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:600
msgid "Configures how the objects in the simulation are controlled:"
msgstr "配置仿真中对象的被控方式："

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:603
msgid ""
"`auto`: Automatic control by the input velocities defined in python "
"script or behavior in the YAML file."
msgstr "`auto`：通过 Python 脚本中定义的输入速度或 YAML 文件中的行为进行自动控制。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:604
msgid ""
"`keyboard`: Manual control via keyboard inputs. The key inputs are "
"defined in the file."
msgstr "`keyboard`：通过键盘输入进行手动控制。按键输入在文件中定义。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:607
msgid "**`collision_mode`** (`str`, default: `\"stop\"`)"
msgstr "**`collision_mode`** (`str`, 默认： `\"stop\"`)"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:608
msgid "Defines how collisions between objects are handled in the simulation:"
msgstr "定义仿真中对象碰撞的处理方式："

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:611
msgid "`stop`: Stops the movement of objects upon collision. (default)"
msgstr "`stop`：发生碰撞时立即停止（默认）。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:612
msgid ""
"`unobstructed`: Allows objects to pass through each other without "
"consideration of any collision."
msgstr "`unobstructed`：允许对象彼此穿过，不考虑任何碰撞。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:613
msgid ""
"`unobstructed_obstacles`: Only allows obstacles to pass through each "
"other without consideration of any collision. The robots will stop when "
"they are in collision with the obstacles."
msgstr "`unobstructed_obstacles`：仅允许障碍物彼此穿过而不考虑碰撞；机器人与障碍物发生碰撞时仍会停止。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:616
msgid "**`status`** (`str`, default: `\"None\"`)"
msgstr "**`status`** (`str`, 默认值： `\"None\"`)"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:617
msgid ""
"Sets the label displayed before the first completed simulation step. It "
"accepts any string and defaults to the `\"None\"` sentinel."
msgstr "设置第一个完整仿真步之前显示的标签。该字段接受任意字符串，默认使用 `\"None\"` 哨兵值。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:619
msgid ""
"After each completed step, IR-SIM replaces this label with the computed "
"runtime status, such as `\"Running\"`, `\"Arrived\"`, or `\"Collision\"`."
msgstr ""
"每个完整仿真步结束后，IR-SIM 会用计算得到的运行时状态替换该标签，例如 `\"Running\"`、`\"Arrived\"` 或 "
"`\"Collision\"`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:621
msgid ""
"**Note**: This setting does not control execution. In particular, "
"`status: \"Pause\"` does not start a paused simulation. Use `env.pause()`"
" and `env.resume()` to control execution, and `env.done()` to check "
"completion."
msgstr ""
"**注意**：此设置不控制执行。尤其是，`status: \"Pause\"` 不会让仿真以暂停状态启动。请使用 `env.pause()` 和 "
"`env.resume()` 控制执行，并使用 `env.done()` 检查是否完成。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md
msgid "**world map**"
msgstr "**world 地图**"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:628
msgid "**`obstacle_map`** (`dict`, `str`, `ndarray`, or `null`, default: `None`)"
msgstr "**`obstacle_map`**（`dict`、`str`、`ndarray` 或 `null`，默认值：`None`）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:629
msgid ""
"Occupancy grid source. **Canonical form is a generator spec dict** with "
"``name``; other types are convenience/backward compat."
msgstr "占据栅格来源。**标准形式是带 ``name`` 的生成器配置字典**；其他类型为便捷写法/向后兼容。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:631
msgid ""
"**Generator spec** (`dict`): ``name`` identifies the generator. ``name: "
"image`` with ``path`` (e.g. ``'cave.png'``) loads an image; grid size "
"from the image. ``name: perlin`` (and others) require ``resolution``; "
"grid size = world size / resolution. See [Configure grid "
"map](../usage/configure_grid_map.md). To add a new generator, see [Adding"
" a new map generator](../usage/configure_grid_map.md#adding-a-new-map-"
"generator)."
msgstr ""
"**生成器配置**（`dict`）：``name`` 标识生成器。``name: image`` 配合 ``path``（例如 "
"``'cave.png'``）从图像加载，栅格大小取自图像。``name: perlin``（及其他）需要 ``resolution``；栅格大小"
" = 世界大小 / resolution。参见 "
"[配置栅格地图](../usage/configure_grid_map.md)。要新增生成器，参见 "
"[新增地图生成器](../usage/configure_grid_map.md#adding-a-new-map-generator)。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:632
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Image path** (`str`): Treated as ``{ name: image, path: obstacle_map "
"}`` (backward compat)."
msgstr "**图像路径**（`str`）：等价于 ``{ name: image, path: obstacle_map }``（向后兼容）。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:633
msgid ""
"**Occupancy grid** (`ndarray`): Programmatic use only. Float 0–100; world"
" size must match grid shape."
msgstr "**占据栅格**（`ndarray`）：仅供编程方式使用。浮点值 0–100；世界大小必须与栅格形状匹配。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:634
msgid "**`null`**: No obstacle map (empty world)."
msgstr "**`null`**：无障碍物地图（空世界）。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:636
msgid ""
"**Available Maps**: We provide some example maps in the `irsim/world/map`"
" folder and you can also use your own map by 3D datasets like "
"[HM3D](https://aihabitat.org/datasets/hm3d/), "
"[MatterPort3D](https://niessner.github.io/Matterport/), "
"[Gibson](http://gibsonenv.stanford.edu/database/), etc. See "
"[here](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-"
"sim/tree/features/irsim/world/map/binary_map_generator_hm3d) for more "
"details."
msgstr ""
"**可用地图**：我们在 `irsim/world/map` 文件夹中提供了一些示例地图，你也可以使用来自 "
"[HM3D](https://aihabitat.org/datasets/hm3d/)、[MatterPort3D](https://niessner.github.io/Matterport/)、[Gibson](http://gibsonenv.stanford.edu/database/)"
" 等 3D 数据集的自定义地图。更多细节见 [此处](https://github.com/hanruihua/ir-"
"sim/tree/features/irsim/world/map/binary_map_generator_hm3d)。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:652
msgid "**`mdownsample`** (`int`, default: `1`)"
msgstr "**`mdownsample`** (`int`, 默认值： `1`)"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:653
msgid "Sets the downsampling factor for the obstacle map image."
msgstr "设置障碍物地图图像的降采样系数。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:655
msgid ""
"**Performance Tip**: A higher value reduces the resolution of the "
"obstacle map, which can optimize the simulation performance by decreasing"
" computational load."
msgstr "**提示**：更高的取值会降低障碍地图的分辨率，减小计算负载，从而提升仿真性能。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:658
msgid "**`fog_map`** (`bool`, default: `false`)"
msgstr "**`fog_map`** (`bool`, 默认值： `false`)"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:659
msgid ""
"Enables a **fog-of-map** overlay (`FogMap`) covering the whole world. "
"Every cell starts grey (unexplored). Each robot reveals cells along its "
"lidar's line of sight, or within its field-of-view sector "
"([`fov`](#p-o-fov) / `fov_radius`) when it has no lidar, so the explored "
"region grows as the robot navigates; revealed cells become transparent "
"and the underlying map shows through (free space white, obstacles black, "
"unknown grey). The explored mask is updated every step even when "
"headless, so it can also be used as an exploration/coverage signal "
"(`env._world.fog_map.explored_ratio`). See the `usage/24fog_world` "
"example."
msgstr ""
"启用覆盖整个世界的**地图迷雾**叠加层（`FogMap`）。每个栅格初始为灰色（未探索）。每个机器人沿其激光雷达视线揭示栅格，若没有激光雷达，则在其视场扇形（[`fov`](#p-o-fov)"
" / "
"`fov_radius`）内揭示，因此随着机器人移动，已探索区域不断扩大；已揭示的栅格变为透明，露出底层地图（空闲为白色、障碍为黑色、未知为灰色）。即使无显示（headless），已探索掩码也会每步更新，可用作探索/覆盖率信号（`env._world.fog_map.explored_ratio`）。参见"
" `usage/24fog_world` 示例。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:662
msgid ""
"**`fog_map_resolution`** (`float`, default: obstacle map cell size, else "
"`0.1`)"
msgstr "**`fog_map_resolution`** (`float`, 默认值：障碍地图栅格尺寸，否则为 `0.1`)"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:663
msgid ""
"Fog cell size in metres, used only when `fog_map: true`. When omitted it "
"matches the obstacle map's cell size, so the fog grid aligns with the "
"map; it falls back to `0.1` m when there is no obstacle map. Finer values"
" give a smoother reveal but cost more memory/time; coarser values are "
"faster."
msgstr ""
"迷雾栅格的尺寸（米），仅在 `fog_map: true` 时使用。省略时与障碍地图的栅格尺寸一致，使迷雾栅格与地图对齐；若无障碍地图则回退为 "
"`0.1` 米。取值越细腻揭示越平滑，但占用更多内存/时间；取值越粗糙则越快。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md
msgid "**world visualization**"
msgstr "**world 可视化**"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:670
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**`plot`** (`dict`, default: `{}`)"
msgstr "**`plot`** (`dict`, 默认值： `{}`)"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:671
msgid "Specifies the plotting options for initializing the plot of the world."
msgstr "指定初始化世界绘图时可用的绘制选项。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:673
msgid "**Visualization Options:**"
msgstr "**可视化选项：**"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:674
msgid ""
"`saved_figure`: Default `dpi` is `100`; default format is `png`; default "
"bbox_inches is `tight`. See "
"[matplotlib.pyplot.savefig](https://matplotlib.org/stable/api/_as_gen/matplotlib.pyplot.savefig.html)"
" for more details."
msgstr ""
"`saved_figure`：默认 `dpi` 为 `100`；默认格式为 `png`；默认 bbox_inches 为 "
"`tight`。更多细节参见 "
"[matplotlib.pyplot.savefig](https://matplotlib.org/stable/api/_as_gen/matplotlib.pyplot.savefig.html)。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:675
msgid ""
"`figure_pixels`: Width and height of the figure in pixels. Default is "
"`[1000, 800]`."
msgstr "`figure_pixels`: 图像的像素宽和高，默认值为`[1000, 800]`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:676
msgid "`show_title`: Whether to show the plot title. Default is `True`."
msgstr "`show_title`: 是否显示图表标题，默认是`True`."

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:677
msgid ""
"`title`: Custom title for the plot. If not specified, shows simulation "
"time and status."
msgstr "`title`：自定义图表标题；若未指定，则显示仿真时间与当前状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:678
msgid "`no_axis`: Whether to show the axis. Default is `False`."
msgstr "`no_axis`： 是否显示坐标轴，默认是`False`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:679
msgid "`tight`: Whether to use tight layout. Default is `True`."
msgstr "`tight`: 是否使用紧凑布局，默认是`True`."

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:680
msgid ""
"`viewpoint`: Controls the center of the camera/viewport. Default is "
"`null`."
msgstr "`viewpoint`: 控制相机（视角）的中心位置，默认值为`null`."

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:681
msgid "`null`: Use the initial world bounds (no automatic panning)."
msgstr "`null`：使用初始的世界边界，不进行自动移动"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:682
msgid "`[x, y]`: Keep the viewport centered at the fixed point `[x, y]`."
msgstr "`[x, y]`：视角始终以固定点`[x, y]`为中心"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:683
msgid ""
"`\"<object_name>\"`: Follow the object with that name (dynamic panning), "
"e.g., `\"robot_0\"`."
msgstr "`\"<object_name>\"`：跟随该名称的对象进行动态平移，例如`\"robot_0\"`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:695
msgid "Complete World Configuration Example"
msgstr "完整世界配置示例"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:722
msgid ""
"**`obstacle_map`**: Replace `\"path/to/map.png\"` with the actual file "
"path to your obstacle map image. Ensure that the image is in a compatible"
" format (e.g., PNG, JPEG) and properly represents obstacle locations."
msgstr ""
"**`obstacle_map`**：将 `\"path/to/map.png\"` "
"替换为你的障碍物地图图像的实际文件路径。请确保图像为兼容格式（如 PNG、JPEG）并正确表示障碍物位置。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:728
msgid "Object Configuration"
msgstr "Object 配置"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:730
msgid ""
"All `robot` and `obstacle` entities in the simulation are configured as "
"objects with similar parameters but may have different default values. "
"This section outlines the configuration parameters available for these "
"objects."
msgstr "仿真中的 `robot` 与 `obstacle` 都作为对象进行配置，参数结构类似但默认值可能不同。本节介绍这些对象可用的配置项。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:733
msgid "Object Parameters Table"
msgstr "Object Parameters Table"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:721
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1360
msgid "Parameter"
msgstr "Parameter"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:721
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1360
msgid "Type"
msgstr "类型"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:721
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1360
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认值"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:721
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1360
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:721
msgid "`str` or `list` of `str`"
msgstr "`str` 或者 `list` of `str`"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:721
msgid ""
"Unique identifier for the object. If omitted, auto-assigned as "
"`\"<role>_<id>\"`. Supports a list when `number > 1`."
msgstr "对象的唯一标识符；若省略，则会自动分配为`\"<role>_<id>\"`。当`number > 1`时支持参数列表。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:721
msgid "`number`"
msgstr "`number`"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:721
msgid "Number of objects to create."
msgstr "要创建的对象数量。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:721
msgid "`distribution`"
msgstr "`distribution`"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:721
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`{name: manual}`"
msgstr "`{name: manual}`"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:721
msgid ""
"Defines how multiple objects are distributed. Support name: `manual`, "
"`random`, `circle`"
msgstr "定义多个对象的分布方式。支持的分布方式有：`manual`, `random`, `circle`"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:721
msgid "`kinematics`"
msgstr "`kinematics`"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:721
msgid ""
"Kinematic model of the object. Supported names: `diff`, `acker`, `omni`, "
"`omni_angular`. An object without kinematics is static."
msgstr "对象的运动学模型。支持 `diff`、`acker`、`omni`、`omni_angular`。没有运动学模型的对象为静态对象。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:721
msgid "`shape`"
msgstr "`shape`"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:721
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Shape of the object. If omitted, IR-SIM creates a circle with radius `1`;"
" an explicit `{name: circle}` uses radius `0.2`. Supported names: "
"`circle`, `rectangle`, `polygon`, `linestring`, `compound`."
msgstr ""
"对象的几何形状。省略时，IR-SIM 创建半径为 `1` 的圆；显式指定 `{name: circle}` 时使用半径 `0.2`。支持 "
"`circle`、`rectangle`、`polygon`、`linestring`、`compound`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:721
msgid "`state`"
