#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:772
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1048
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1234
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1328
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1360
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:774
msgid "**`number`**: How many objects to create"
msgstr "**`number`** — 创建多少个对象"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:775
msgid "**`distribution`**: Object placement (`manual`, `random`, `circle`)"
msgstr "**`distribution`** — 对象摆放位置分布 (`manual`, `random`, `circle`)"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:776
msgid "**`state`**: Initial position (`[x, y, θ]`)"
msgstr "**`state`** — 初始化位置 (`[x, y, θ]`)"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:777
msgid "**`goal`**: Target destination (`[x, y, θ]`)"
msgstr "**`goal`** — 目标位姿 (`[x, y, θ]`)"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:778
msgid "**`velocity`**: Initial speed (`[v, ω]`, `[forward, lateral]`, `[v, φ]`)"
msgstr "**`velocity`** — 初始化速度 (`[v, ω]`, `[forward, lateral]`, `[v, φ]`)"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:779
msgid "**`state_dim`**: State vector size (auto: 3 or 4)"
msgstr "**`state_dim`** — 状态向量维度 (auto: 3 或 4)"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:780
msgid "**`vel_dim`**: Velocity vector size (auto: 2)"
msgstr "**`vel_dim`** — 速度向量维度 (auto: 2)"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:781
msgid "**`name`**: Unique identifier for the object."
msgstr "**`name`** — 对象的唯一标识符"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:782
msgid "**`role`**: Object type (`robot`, `obstacle`)"
msgstr "**`role`** — 对象类型（`robot`、`obstacle`）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:786
msgid "**`number`** (`int`, default: `1`)"
msgstr "**`number`** (`int`, 默认值： `1`)"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:787
msgid "Specifies the number of objects to create using the given configuration."
msgstr "指定使用该配置创建的对象数量。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:796
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**`distribution`** (`dict`, default: `{name: manual}`) ([source](https"
"://ir-"
"sim.readthedocs.io/en/dev/irsim.world.html#irsim.world.object_factory.ObjectFactory.generate_state_list))"
msgstr ""
"**`distribution`**（`dict`，默认值：`{name: manual}`）（[源码](https://ir-"
"sim.readthedocs.io/en/dev/irsim.world.html#irsim.world.object_factory.ObjectFactory.generate_state_list)）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:797
msgid ""
"Defines how multiple objects are spatially distributed when `number` is "
"greater than `1`."
msgstr "当`number`大于1时，定义多个对象在空间中的分布方式。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:800
msgid "`'manual'`: Manually specify initial states and goals for each object."
msgstr "`'manual'`:手动为每个对象指定初始状态和目标"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:801
msgid ""
"In this case, the `state` (or goal) parameters must be provided for each "
"object. If the provided list is shorter than the number of objects, the "
"last state (or goal) is repeated."
msgstr "这种模式下必须为每个对象提供`state`（或目标）参数；如果提供的列表长度少于对象数量，则最后一个状态（或目标）会被重复使用。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:810
msgid ""
"`'random'`: Randomly distribute objects within specified ranges. Points "
"are rejection-sampled so every pair is at least `min_distance` apart in "
"the xy plane. Optional parameters:"
msgstr ""
"`'random'`: 在指定范围内随机分布对象。采样过程采用拒绝采样，保证任意两点在 xy 平面上的距离至少为 "
"`min_distance`。可选参数："

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:811
msgid ""
"`range_low` (list): Lower bounds `[x, y, theta]` for random distribution."
" Defaults to the world bounds inset by `0.5`, i.e. `[offset_x + 0.5, "
"offset_y + 0.5, -pi]`."
msgstr ""
"`range_low` (list): 随机分布的下界 `[x, y, theta]`。默认值为世界边界向内缩进 `0.5`，即 "
"`[offset_x + 0.5, offset_y + 0.5, -pi]`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:812
msgid ""
"`range_high` (list): Upper bounds `[x, y, theta]` for random "
"distribution. Defaults to `[offset_x + width - 0.5, offset_y + height - "
"0.5, pi]`."
msgstr ""
"`range_high` (list): 随机分布的上界 `[x, y, theta]`。默认值为 `[offset_x + width - "
"0.5, offset_y + height - 0.5, pi]`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:813
msgid ""
"`min_distance` (float): Minimum pairwise xy distance between sampled "
"points. Default is `1.0`."
msgstr "`min_distance` (float): 采样点之间在 xy 平面上的最小两两距离。默认值为 `1.0`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:820
msgid ""
"`'circle'`: Arrange objects in a circular formation around a specified "
"center. Optional parameters:"
msgstr "`'circle'`:将对象以圆形阵列排布在指定中心周围。可选参数："

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:821
msgid ""
"`center` (list): Center coordinates `[x, y, theta]` of the circle. "
"Defaults to the world center `[offset_x + width / 2, offset_y + height / "
"2, 0]`."
msgstr ""
"`center` (list): 圆心坐标 `[x, y, theta]`。默认值为世界中心 `[offset_x + width / 2, "
"offset_y + height / 2, 0]`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:822
msgid ""
"`radius` (float): Radius of the circle. Defaults to `min(width, height) /"
" 2 - 0.5` so the circle sits inside the world with a small margin."
msgstr "`radius` (float): 圆的半径。默认值为 `min(width, height) / 2 - 0.5`，使圆形排布留有少量边距。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:830
msgid ""
"**`state`** (`list` of `float`, default: `[1, 1, 0]` for manual "
"distribution)"
msgstr "**`state`**（`float` 列表，手动分布时默认：`[1, 1, 0]`）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:831
msgid ""
"Defines the initial state of the object, typically in the format `[x, y, "
"theta]`, where `theta` represents the orientation in radians. If the "
"provided state has more elements than required, extra elements are "
"truncated; if fewer, missing values are filled with zeros. Random and "
"circle distributions generate states from their distribution parameters."
msgstr ""
"定义对象的初始状态，通常为 `[x, y, theta]` 格式，其中 `theta` "
"表示以弧度为单位的朝向。若提供的状态元素多于所需，多余的会被截断；若不足，缺失值以零补齐。随机分布和圆形分布会根据其分布参数生成状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:839
msgid "**`velocity`** (`list` of `float`, default: `[0] * action_dim`)"
msgstr "**`velocity`**（`float` 列表，默认：`[0] * action_dim`）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:840
msgid ""
"Specifies the initial velocity (list) of the object. The length must "
"match the kinematics action dimension. The format depends on the "
"kinematics model:"
msgstr "指定对象的初始速度（列表）。长度须与运动学动作维度匹配。格式取决于运动学模型："

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:842
msgid "**Format by Kinematics:**"
msgstr "**运动学模型的格式：**"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:843
msgid ""
"For `'diff'`: `[v, omega]`, where `v` is linear velocity and `omega` is "
"angular velocity."
msgstr "`'diff'`模型参数由`[v, omega]`构成， 其中 `v` 线速度，`omega`角速度。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:844
msgid ""
"For `'omni'`: `[forward, lateral]`, body-frame velocities (forward and "
"lateral relative to heading)."
msgstr "`'omni'`模型参数由`[forward, lateral]`构成，为机体坐标系下的速度（相对于朝向的前进和横向速度）。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:845
msgid ""
"For `'acker'`: Typically `[v, phi]`, where `v` is linear velocity and "
"`phi` is steering angle."
msgstr "`'acker'`模型参数通常由`[v, phi]`构成，其中 `v` 是线速度，`phi`是转向角。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:853
msgid ""
"**`goal`** (`list` of `float` or `list` of `list` of `float`, default: "
"`[1, 9, 0]` for manual distribution)"
msgstr "**`goal`**（`float` 列表或 `float` 列表的列表，手动分布时默认：`[1, 9, 0]`）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:854
msgid ""
"Sets the target state or position the object should move toward. Used in "
"conjunction with behaviors to guide the object's navigation. The format "
"is `[x, y, theta]` or `[[x, y, theta], [x, y, theta], ...]` for multiple "
"goals. Random and circle distributions generate goals from their "
"distribution parameters."
msgstr ""
"设置对象应移动到的目标状态或位置。与行为配合使用以引导对象导航。格式为 `[x, y, theta]`，或多目标时为 `[[x, y, "
"theta], [x, y, theta], ...]`。随机分布和圆形分布会根据其分布参数生成目标。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:861
msgid ""
"**Note**: For multiple goals for the single object (Pay attention to the "
"difference between the single goal for multiple objects and multiple "
"goals for the single object):"
msgstr "**注意**：对于单个对象的多个目标（注意区分多个对象的单个目标与单个对象的多个目标）："

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:870
msgid "**`state_dim`** (`int`, default: `None`)"
msgstr "**`state_dim`** (`int`, 默认值： `None`)"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:871
msgid ""
"Explicitly defines the dimension of the state vector. When not specified,"
" this is automatically inferred from the kinematics model. For most use "
"cases, the default inference is sufficient."
msgstr "显式定义状态向量的维度。若未指定，则自动从运动学模型推断。对于大多数使用场景，默认推断即可满足需求。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:873
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:886
msgid "**Common Values:**"
msgstr "**常用值：**"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:874
msgid "`3`: For 2D position and orientation `[x, y, theta]`"
msgstr "`3`: 2D的位置和朝向角 `[x, y, theta]`"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:875
msgid ""
"`4`: For vehicles with additional state (e.g., Ackermann with `[x, y, "
"theta, steer_angle]`)"
msgstr "`4`：对于具有额外状态的车辆（例如 Ackermann 模型的`[x, y, theta, steer_angle]`）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:883
msgid "**`vel_dim`** (`int`, default: `None`)"
msgstr "**`vel_dim`** (`int`, 默认值： `None`)"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:884
msgid ""
"Explicitly defines the dimension of the velocity vector. When not "
"specified, this is automatically inferred from the kinematics model. The "
"velocity dimension depends on the control inputs for the specific "
"kinematics."
msgstr "显式定义速度向量的维度。若未指定，则自动从运动学模型推断。速度维度取决于特定运动学模型的控制输入。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:887
msgid ""
"`2`: For differential drive `[v, omega]` or omnidirectional `[forward, "
"lateral]`"
msgstr "`2`：对于差速驱动`[v, omega]`或全向 `[forward, lateral]`"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:888
msgid ""
"`3`: For omnidirectional with angular control `[forward, lateral, "
"yaw_rate]`"
msgstr "`3`：对于带角速度控制的全向模型 `[forward, lateral, yaw_rate]`"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:896
msgid "**`group`** (`int`, default: `0`)"
msgstr "**`group`**（`int`，默认 `0`）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:897
msgid ""
"Specifies a group identifier for organizational purposes, allowing "
"objects to be categorized and managed together. Objects with the same "
"group ID can be treated as a cohesive unit for certain operations."
msgstr "指定用于组织目的的分组标识符，允许对象被分类和管理。具有相同分组 ID 的对象可作为一个整体用于某些操作。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:905
msgid "**`group_name`** (`str`, default: `None`)"
msgstr "**`group_name`** (`str`, 默认值为: `None`)"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:906
msgid ""
"Specifies a group name for organizational purposes, allowing objects to "
"be categorized and managed together. Objects with the same group name can"
" be treated as a cohesive unit for certain operations."
msgstr "用于组织目的指定分组名称，使对象能够被分类并统一管理。具有相同分组名称的对象在某些操作中可作为一个整体进行处理。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:914
msgid "**`name`** (`str` or `list` of `str`, default: `None`)"
msgstr "**`name`**（`str` 或 `str` 列表，默认 `None`）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:915
msgid ""
"Sets a unique identifier for the object. If not provided, the name "
"defaults to \"<role>_<id>\" (e.g., `robot_0`, `obstacle_3`). Names must "
"be unique across all objects in the environment; duplicates will raise a "
"`ValueError` during initialization."
msgstr ""
"为对象设置唯一标识符。若未提供，名称默认为 \"<role>_<id>\"（例如 "
"`robot_0`、`obstacle_3`）。名称在环境中所有对象间必须唯一；重复会在初始化时抛出 `ValueError`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:917
msgid ""
"When creating multiple objects (`number > 1`), you can provide a list of "
"names. If the provided list is shorter than the number of objects, the "
"last name is repeated for remaining objects; ensure uniqueness to avoid "
"errors."
msgstr "创建多个对象（`number > 1`）时，可提供名称列表。若列表长度小于对象数量，则最后一个名称会被重复使用；请确保名称唯一性以避免错误。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:940
msgid ""
"Do not confuse the object-level `name` with the `name` keys inside "
"dictionaries like `shape`, `kinematics`, or `behavior`. The latter "
"specify the type of that component, not the object's identifier."
msgstr ""
"请勿将对象级 `name` 与 `shape`、`kinematics`、`behavior` 等字典内部的 `name` "
"键混淆。后者指定该组件的类型，而非对象的标识符。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:943
msgid "**`role`** (`str`, inferred from top-level key)"
msgstr "**`role`**（`str`，从顶层键推断）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:944
msgid ""
"Defines the object's role in the simulation. In YAML configurations, this"
" is inferred from the section it belongs to and normally does not need to"
" be set manually:"
msgstr "定义对象在仿真中的角色。在 YAML 配置中，该值由对象所属的配置区块推断，通常无需手动设置："

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:945
msgid ""
"`'robot'`: An active entity typically controlled by behaviors or input "
"commands."
msgstr "`'robot'`：主动实体，通常由行为或输入命令控制。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:946
msgid ""
"`'obstacle'`: A passive entity that may or may not move but is considered"
" during collision detection."
msgstr "`'obstacle'`：被动实体，可静止也可移动，但参与碰撞检测。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md
msgid "**object kinematics**"
msgstr "**object 运动学**"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:952
msgid "Kinematics Models"
msgstr "运动学模型"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:954
msgid ""
"**`diff`**: Differential drive, controlled by linear speed and angular "
"velocity (`[v, omega]`)"
msgstr "**`diff`** — 差速驱动，由线速度和角速度控制（`[v, omega]`）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:955
msgid ""
"**`omni`**: Omnidirectional, controlled by body-frame forward and lateral"
" speed (`[forward, lateral]`)"
msgstr "**`omni`** — 全向移动，由机体坐标系下的前进和横向速度控制（`[forward, lateral]`）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:956
msgid ""
"**`omni_angular`**: Omnidirectional with angular control, controlled by "
"body-frame speeds and yaw rate (`[forward, lateral, yaw_rate]`)"
msgstr ""
"**`omni_angular`** — 带角速度控制的全向移动，由机体坐标系下的速度和偏航角速度控制（`[forward, lateral, "
"yaw_rate]`）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:957
msgid ""
"**`acker`**: Ackermann steering, controlled by linear speed and steering "
"angle (`[v, phi]`)"
msgstr "**`acker`** — 阿克曼转向，由线速度和转向角控制（`[v, phi]`）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:959
msgid ""
"Velocity commands are expressed in the robot's own frame, while `[vx, "
"vy]` describes the rigid-body motion in the world frame. A holonomic "
"planner such as RVO, SFM or ORCA plans in the world frame, so its "
"velocity is converted at that boundary. An external controller that plans"
" in the world frame converts the same way:"
msgstr ""
"速度指令在机器人自身坐标系下表示，而 `[vx, vy]` 描述的是世界坐标系下的刚体运动。RVO、SFM、ORCA "
"等全向规划器在世界坐标系下求解，因此其速度会在该边界处完成转换。在世界坐标系下规划的外部控制器同样按此转换："

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:965
msgid ""
"`omni` rotates `[vx, vy]` into `[forward, lateral]`, and `diff` maps it "
"to `[linear, angular]` using the robot's angular limit and the world step"
" time. `acker` and `omni_angular` are commanded directly, and a world-"
"frame translation does not determine their command, so the conversion "
"raises for them."
msgstr ""
"`omni` 将 `[vx, vy]` 旋转为 `[forward, lateral]`；`diff` "
"则依据机器人的角速度上限与世界步长，将其映射为 `[linear, angular]`。`acker` 与 `omni_angular` "
"由指令直接控制，世界坐标系下的平移速度无法确定其指令，因此该转换会抛出异常。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1041
msgid ""
"When using the `acker` kinematics model, ensure that the `wheelbase` "
"parameter is set in the `shape` configuration; a `wheelbase` under "
"`kinematics` overrides it."
msgstr ""
"使用 `acker` 运动学模型时，请确保在 `shape` 配置中设置 `wheelbase` 参数；`kinematics` 下的 "
"`wheelbase` 会覆盖它。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md
msgid "**object shape**"
msgstr "**object 形状**"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1050
msgid "**`circle`**: Round shape (`radius`, `center`)"
msgstr "**`circle`** — 圆形（`radius`、`center`）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1051
msgid "**`rectangle`**: Rectangular shape (`length`, `width`, `wheelbase`)"
msgstr "**`rectangle`** — 矩形（`length`、`width`、`wheelbase`）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1052
msgid "**`polygon`**: Custom shape (`vertices`, `is_convex`)"
msgstr "**`polygon`** — 自定义多边形（`vertices`、`is_convex`）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1053
msgid "**`compound`**: Fixed collection of solid parts (`parts`, `pose`)"
msgstr "**`compound`** — 固定实体部件的组合（`parts`、`pose`）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1054
msgid "**`linestring`**: Line segments (`vertices`)"
msgstr "**`linestring`** — 线段（`vertices`）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1058
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**`shape`** (`dict`, default: `{name: circle}`)"
msgstr "**`shape`**（`dict`，默认 `{name: circle}`）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1059
msgid ""
"Determines the geometric shape used for collision detection and "
"visualization in the original state. If `shape` is omitted entirely, the "
"object falls back to a circle of `radius: 1` centered at `[0, 0]`; the "
"`radius: 0.2` below is the default only when a `circle` shape is given "
"without an explicit `radius`."
msgstr ""
"决定初始状态下用于碰撞检测和可视化的几何形状。如果完全省略 `shape`，对象将回退为以 `[0, 0]` 为中心、`radius: 1` "
"的圆；下面的 `radius: 0.2` 仅在给定 `circle` 形状但未显式指定 `radius` 时作为默认值。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1061
msgid "**Supported Shapes:**"
msgstr "**支持的形状：**"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1063
msgid "**`'circle'`**: Represents a circular shape."
msgstr "**`'circle'`**：圆形。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1064
msgid "**`radius`** (`float`): Radius of the circle. Default is `0.2`."
msgstr "**`radius`**（`float`）：圆半径，默认 `0.2`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1065
msgid ""
"**`center`** (`list`): Body-frame `[x, y]` offset of the circle center. "
"It rotates with the object's heading. Default is `[0, 0]`. For an "
"Ackermann circle, the effective center is additionally shifted forward by"
" `wheelbase / 2`."
msgstr ""
"**`center`**（`list`）：圆心在机体坐标系中的 `[x, y]` 偏移，会随对象朝向旋转。默认值为 `[0, "
"0]`。对于阿克曼圆形，实际圆心还会向前偏移 `wheelbase / 2`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1066
msgid ""
"**`random_shape`** (`bool`): Whether to generate a random radius. Default"
" is `False`."
msgstr "**`random_shape`**（`bool`）：是否随机半径，默认 `False`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1067
msgid ""
"**`radius_range`** (`list`): Range `[min_radius, max_radius]` for random "
"radius generation if `random_shape` is `True`. Default is `[0.1, 1.0]`."
msgstr ""
"**`radius_range`**（`list`）：当 `random_shape` 为 `True` 时用于随机半径生成的范围 "
"`[min_radius, max_radius]`。默认值为 `[0.1, 1.0]`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1068
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1078
msgid ""
"**`wheelbase`** (`float`): Wheelbase of the Ackermann steering vehicle. "
"Required when using `'acker'` kinematics. Default is `None`."
msgstr "**`wheelbase`**（`float`）：阿克曼转向车辆的轴距，使用 `'acker'` 时必填，默认 `None`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1075
msgid "**`'rectangle'`**: Represents a rectangular shape."
msgstr "**`'rectangle'`**：矩形。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1076
msgid ""
"**`length`** (`float`): Length of the rectangle along the x-axis. Default"
" is `1.0`."
msgstr "**`length`**（`float`）：x 轴方向长度，默认 `1.0`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1077
msgid ""
"**`width`** (`float`): Width of the rectangle along the y-axis. Default "
"is `1.0`."
msgstr "**`width`**（`float`）：y 轴方向宽度，默认 `1.0`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1085
msgid ""
"**`'polygon'`**: Represents a polygonal shape defined by a list of "
"vertices."
msgstr "**`'polygon'`**：由顶点列表定义的多边形。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1086
msgid ""
"**`vertices`** (`list`): List of vertices defining the polygon in the "
"format `[[x1, y1], [x2, y2], ...]`, if not provided, a random polygon "
"will be generated."
msgstr "**`vertices`**（列表）：定义多边形的顶点列表，格式 `[[x1, y1], ...]`。若未提供则生成随机多边形。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1087
msgid ""
"**`random_shape`** (`bool`): Whether to generate a series of random "
"polygons. Default is `False`."
msgstr "**`random_shape`**（`bool`）：是否生成一系列随机多边形，默认 `False`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1088
msgid ""
"**`is_convex`** (`bool`): Whether to generate a series of random convex "
"polygons. Default is `False`."
msgstr "**`is_convex`**（`bool`）：是否生成一系列随机凸多边形，默认 `False`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1107
msgid ""
"**`'compound'`**: Represents one rigid shape assembled from fixed solid "
"parts."
msgstr "**`'compound'`**：表示由固定实体部件组合而成的一个刚性形状。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1108
msgid ""
"**`parts`** (`list`): Non-empty list of `circle`, `rectangle`, or "
"`polygon` shape dictionaries."
msgstr "**`parts`**（`list`）：由 `circle`、`rectangle` 或 `polygon` 形状字典组成的非空列表。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1109
msgid ""
"**`pose`** (`list`): Optional `[x, y, theta]` pose of a part relative to "
"the owning object's coordinate-frame origin. Default is `[0, 0, 0]`, and "
"`theta` is in radians."
msgstr ""
"**`pose`**（`list`）：部件相对于所属对象坐标系原点的可选 `[x, y, theta]` 位姿。默认值为 `[0, 0, "
"0]`，`theta` 使用弧度。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1120
msgid ""
"**`'linestring'`**: Represents a line string shape defined by a list of "
"vertices. Similar to a polygon but generates a line string."
msgstr "**`'linestring'`**：由顶点列表定义的折线，类似多边形但生成的是一串线。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1121
msgid ""
"**`vertices`** (`list`): List of vertices defining the line string in the"
" format `[[x1, y1], [x2, y2], ...]`."
msgstr "**`vertices`**（列表）：定义线串的顶点列表，格式 `[[x1, y1], ...]`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1122
msgid ""
"**`random_shape`** (`bool`): Whether to generate a series of random line "
"strings (polygon). Default is `False`."
msgstr "**`random_shape`**（`bool`）：是否生成随机线串（多边形），默认 `False`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1123
msgid ""
"**`is_convex`** (`bool`): Whether to generate a series of random convex "
"line strings (polygons). Default is `True`."
msgstr "**`is_convex`**（`bool`）：是否生成随机凸线串（多边形），默认 `True`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md
msgid "**object behavior**"
msgstr "**object 行为**"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1146
msgid "Behavior Systems"
msgstr "行为系统"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1148
msgid ""
"**`behavior`**: `dash` (move toward the goal directly), `rvo` (reciprocal"
" velocity obstacles), `sfm` (social force model)"
msgstr "**`behavior`**：`dash`（直接朝目标移动）、`rvo`（互惠速度障碍）、`sfm`（社会力模型）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1149
msgid "**`group_behavior`**: `orca` (optimal reciprocal collision avoidance)"
msgstr "**`group_behavior`**：`orca`（最优互惠碰撞避免）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1150
msgid "**`static`**: Immobile objects (`True`/`False`)"
msgstr "**`static`** — 静止对象（`True`/`False`）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1154
msgid "**`behavior`** (`dict`, default: `None`)"
msgstr "**`behavior`**（`dict`，默认 `None`）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1155
msgid ""
"Configures the movement behavior of the object. Behaviors can be simple "
"or complex and may include additional parameters."
msgstr "配置对象的运动行为，可为简单或复杂策略，并可包含额外参数。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1158
msgid "`'dash'`: Moves directly toward the goal at maximum allowable speed."
msgstr "`'dash'`：以最大允许速度直接朝目标移动。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1159
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1172
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1200
msgid ""
"`wander` (bool/`False`): Whether to add random wandering to the movement."
" If `True`, the object will have a random goal when reach current goal."
msgstr "`wander`（bool/`False`）：是否加入随机游走。若为 `True`，对象到达当前目标后会随机分配新目标。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1160
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1173
msgid ""
"`loop` (bool/`False`): Whether to loop through waypoints continuously. If"
" `True`, the object will restart from the first waypoint after reaching "
"the last one."
msgstr "`loop`（bool/`False`）：是否循环导航路径点。若为 `True`，对象到达最后一个路径点后会从第一个路径点重新开始。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1161
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1174
msgid ""
"`target_roles` (str/`all`): Only the objects with the target role will be"
" applied to the behavior. Currently, you can set the target role as "
"`robot` or `obstacle`."
msgstr "`target_roles`（str/`all`）：仅对具有目标角色的对象应用该行为。当前可设为 `robot` 或 `obstacle`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1162
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1175
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1201
msgid "`range_low`(list/`[0, 0, -3.14]`): Lower bounds for random wandering."
msgstr "`range_low`（列表）：随机游走下界，默认 `[0, 0, -3.14]`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1163
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1176
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1202
msgid "`range_high`(list/`[10, 10, 3.14]`): Upper bounds for random wandering."
msgstr "`range_high`（列表）：随机游走上界，默认 `[10, 10, 3.14]`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1164
msgid ""
"`angle_tolerance` (float/`0.1`): Tolerance for orientation alignment with"
" `diff`, `acker`, and `omni_angular` kinematics."
msgstr ""
"`angle_tolerance`（float）：`diff`、`acker`、`omni_angular` 运动学的朝向校准容差，默认 "
"`0.1`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1166
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1187
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1210
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1225
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1261
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1299
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1318
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1342
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1351
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1376
#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1392
