msgid "**Example:**"
msgstr "**示例：**"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1171
msgid ""
"`'rvo'`: Implements Reciprocal Velocity Obstacles for collision avoidance"
" among multiple moving objects. Support kinematics are `diff` and `omni`."
msgstr "`'rvo'`：实现多动态体避碰的 RVO 算法，支持 `diff` 与 `omni` 运动学。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1177
msgid "`vxmax` (float/`1.5`): Maximum linear velocity in x axis."
msgstr "`vxmax`（float）：x 轴最大线速度，默认 `1.5`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1178
msgid "`vymax` (float/`1.5`): Maximum linear velocity in y axis."
msgstr "`vymax`（float）：y 轴最大线速度，默认 `1.5`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1179
msgid "`acce` (float/`1.0`): Maximum acceleration."
msgstr "`acce`（float）：最大加速度，默认 `1.0`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1180
msgid "`factor` (float/`1.0`): Factor for the RVO algorithm."
msgstr "`factor`（float）：RVO 算法因子，默认 `1.0`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1181
msgid "`mode` (str/`rvo`): Mode for RVO algorithm, either `rvo`, `hrvo`, or `vo`."
msgstr "`mode`（str）：RVO 算法模式，可选 `rvo`、`hrvo`、`vo`，默认 `rvo`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1182
msgid "`rvo`: Reciprocal Velocity Obstacles. For multi-agent collision avoidance."
msgstr "`rvo`：互惠速度障碍法，用于多智能体避碰。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1183
msgid ""
"`hrvo`: Hybrid Reciprocal Velocity Obstacles. Combine RVO with VO to "
"avoid deadlocks."
msgstr "`hrvo`：混合 RVO，将 RVO 与 VO 结合以减少死锁。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1184
msgid "`vo`: Velocity Obstacles. For obstacle avoidance."
msgstr "`vo`：速度障碍，用于避障。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1185
msgid ""
"`neighbor_threshold` (float/`3.0`): Distance threshold to filter the "
"neighbors to the self robot."
msgstr "`neighbor_threshold`（float）：筛选邻居的距离阈值，默认 `3.0`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1192
msgid ""
"`'sfm'`: Implements the Social Force Model for reactive pedestrian-style "
"avoidance. Supported kinematics are `diff` and `omni`."
msgstr "`'sfm'`：实现社会力模型，用于反应式行人风格避障。支持 `diff` 和 `omni` 运动学。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1195
msgid "**`group_behavior`** (`dict`, default: `None`)"
msgstr "**`group_behavior`**（`dict`，默认 `None`）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1196
msgid ""
"Group-level behavior for all objects within the same group. This is more "
"efficient for coordinated behaviors (like swarm or crowd simulation) as "
"it computes actions for all members in a single step. Must include `name`"
" plus behavior-specific parameters."
msgstr "同组内所有对象的群体行为。对于协同行为（如群体或人群仿真）更高效，因为它在单步中为所有成员计算动作。必须包含 `name` 及行为特定参数。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1199
msgid ""
"`'orca'`: Optimal Reciprocal Collision Avoidance (ORCA) for multi-agent "
"navigation. Requires `pyrvo` package (`pip install pyrvo`). The "
"simulation will attempt to import it only when this behavior is used."
msgstr ""
"`'orca'`：用于多智能体导航的最优互惠碰撞避免（ORCA）。需要 `pyrvo` 包（`pip install "
"pyrvo`）。仅在使用该行为时仿真才会尝试导入它。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1203
msgid "`neighborDist` (float/`15.0`): Max distance to search for neighbors."
msgstr "`neighborDist`（float/`15.0`）：搜索邻居的最大距离。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1204
msgid "`maxNeighbors` (int/`10`): Max number of neighbors to consider."
msgstr "`maxNeighbors`（int/`10`）：考虑的邻居数量上限。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1205
msgid ""
"`timeHorizon` (float/`20.0`): Time horizon for computing safe velocities "
"with respect to other agents."
msgstr "`timeHorizon`（float/`20.0`）：相对于其他智能体计算安全速度的时间范围。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1206
msgid ""
"`timeHorizonObst` (float/`10.0`): Time horizon for computing safe "
"velocities with respect to static obstacles."
msgstr "`timeHorizonObst`（float/`10.0`）：相对于静态障碍物计算安全速度的时间范围。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1207
msgid "`safe_radius` (float/`0.1`): Additional safety radius padding."
msgstr "`safe_radius`（float/`0.1`）：额外的安全半径填充。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1208
msgid ""
"`maxSpeed` (float/`None`): Max speed for the agents. If `None`, uses the "
"object's `vel_max`."
msgstr "`maxSpeed`（float/`None`）：智能体最大速度。若为 `None`，使用对象的 `vel_max`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1222
msgid ""
"**`static`**:   A boolean indicating whether the object is static (does "
"not move). Static objects ignore kinematics and behaviors, remaining at "
"their initial state."
msgstr "**`static`**：布尔值，表示对象是否静止。静止对象忽略运动学与行为，保持初始状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md
msgid "**object sensors**"
msgstr "**object 传感器**"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1236
msgid "**`lidar2d`**: 2D laser scanner (`range_min/max`, `angle_range`, `noise`)"
msgstr "**`lidar2d`** — 2D 激光雷达（`range_min/max`、`angle_range`、`noise`）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1237
msgid ""
"**`fmcw_lidar2d`**: 2D FMCW LiDAR (`range/radial_velocity`, "
"`motion_compensate`, Doppler visualization)"
msgstr ""
"**`fmcw_lidar2d`** —— 2D FMCW "
"激光雷达（`range/radial_velocity`、`motion_compensate`、多普勒可视化）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1238
msgid "**`fov`**: Field of view angle (radians)"
msgstr "**`fov`** — 视场角（弧度）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1239
msgid "**`fov_radius`**: Maximum detection distance"
msgstr "**`fov_radius`** — 最大探测距离"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1243
msgid ""
"**`sensors`**:   Attaches sensors to the object for environmental "
"perception. Each sensor is defined by a dictionary indicating its type "
"and specific parameters. Currently supported sensor `name` (or `type`) "
"include:"
msgstr "**`sensors`**：为对象挂载传感器以感知环境。每个传感器以字典形式描述其类型与参数，目前支持："

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1245
msgid "`lidar2d`: 2D LiDAR sensor for distance measurements. Parameters include:"
msgstr "`lidar2d`：用于距离测量的 2D LiDAR，参数包括："

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1246
msgid "`range_min` (float/`0.0`): Minimum detection range."
msgstr "`range_min`（float）：最小探测距离，默认 `0.0`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1247
msgid "`range_max` (float/`10.0`): Maximum detection range."
msgstr "`range_max`（float）：最大探测距离，默认 `10.0`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1248
msgid ""
"`angle_range` (float/`pi`): Total angle range of the sensor, clipped to "
"`[0, 2*pi]` (`6.283185` gives a full 360° scan)."
msgstr ""
"`angle_range`（float）：传感器覆盖角度，默认 `pi`，限制在 `[0, 2*pi]` 内（`6.283185` 为 360° "
"全向扫描）。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1249
msgid "`number` (int/`100`): Number of laser beams."
msgstr "`number`（int）：激光束数量，默认 `100`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1250
msgid "`scan_time` (float/`0.1`): Time taken for one complete scan."
msgstr "`scan_time`（float）：完成一次扫描的时间，默认 `0.1`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1251
msgid "`noise` (bool/`False`): Whether noise is added to measurements."
msgstr "`noise`（bool）：测量是否加入噪声，默认 `False`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1252
msgid ""
"`std` (float/`0.2`): Standard deviation for range noise if `noise` is "
"`True`."
msgstr "`std`（float）：当 `noise=True` 时距离噪声的标准差，默认 `0.2`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1253
msgid ""
"`angle_std` (float/`0.02`): Standard deviation for angle noise if `noise`"
" is `True`."
msgstr "`angle_std`（float）：`noise=True` 时的角度噪声标准差，默认 `0.02`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1254
msgid ""
"`offset` (list/`[0, 0, 0]`): Offset of the sensor from the object's "
"position (x, y, theta)."
msgstr "`offset`（列表）：传感器相对对象位置 (x, y, theta) 的偏移，默认 `[0, 0, 0]`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1255
msgid "`has_velocity` (bool/`False`): Whether measures the lidar point velocity."
msgstr "`has_velocity`（bool）：是否测量点速度，默认 `False`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1257
msgid ""
"Visualization options go under the sensor's **`plot:`** sub-dict (flat "
"top-level keys are still accepted for backward compatibility):"
msgstr "可视化选项位于传感器的 **`plot:`** 子字典下（为向后兼容，仍接受扁平的顶层键）："

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1258
msgid "`alpha` (float/`0.3`): Transparency for plotting."
msgstr "`alpha`（float）：绘图透明度，默认 `0.3`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1259
msgid "`color` (str/`r`): Color of the sensor."
msgstr "`color`（str）：传感器颜色，默认 `r`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1278
msgid ""
"`fmcw_lidar2d`: Simplified 2D FMCW LiDAR for range and radial Doppler "
"measurements. It reuses the beam geometry of `lidar2d` and adds two "
"functional parameters:"
msgstr "`fmcw_lidar2d`：用于距离和径向多普勒测量的简化 2D FMCW 激光雷达。它复用 `lidar2d` 的波束几何，并新增两个功能参数："

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1279
msgid ""
"`motion_compensate` (bool/`False`): Whether to remove ego-motion from the"
" measured radial velocity."
msgstr "`motion_compensate`（bool/`False`）：是否从测得的径向速度中消除自身运动。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1280
msgid ""
"`velocity_noise_std` (float/`0.0`): Standard deviation of Gaussian noise "
"on radial velocity."
msgstr "`velocity_noise_std`（float/`0.0`）：径向速度上高斯噪声的标准差。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1282
msgid ""
"All visualization options go under the sensor's **`plot:`** sub-dict "
"(same convention as `lidar2d` and object `plot:`). Flat top-level keys "
"are still accepted for backward compatibility."
msgstr ""
"所有可视化选项位于传感器的 **`plot:`** 子字典下（与 `lidar2d` 和对象的 `plot:` "
"约定相同）。为向后兼容，仍接受扁平的顶层键。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1283
msgid ""
"`velocity_color` (bool/`True`): Whether to color valid beams by radial "
"velocity."
msgstr "`velocity_color`（bool/`True`）：是否按径向速度为有效波束着色。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1284
msgid ""
"`velocity_color_max` (float/`2.0`): Velocity magnitude where the plotting"
" color saturates."
msgstr "`velocity_color_max`（float/`2.0`）：绘图颜色饱和时对应的速度大小。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1285
msgid "`velocity_linewidth` (float/`2.5`): Plot line width for valid returns."
msgstr "`velocity_linewidth`（float/`2.5`）：有效回波的绘图线宽。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1286
msgid "`no_hit_linewidth` (float/`0.8`): Plot line width for invalid beams."
msgstr "`no_hit_linewidth`（float/`0.8`）：无效波束的绘图线宽。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1287
msgid "`no_hit_alpha` (float/`0.03`): Plot transparency for invalid beams."
msgstr "`no_hit_alpha`（float/`0.03`）：无效波束的绘图透明度。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1288
msgid ""
"`show_velocity_markers` (bool/`True`): Whether to draw colored hit "
"markers at valid endpoints."
msgstr "`show_velocity_markers`（bool/`True`）：是否在有效端点处绘制彩色命中标记。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1289
msgid "`velocity_marker_size` (float/`36`): Plot marker size for valid endpoints."
msgstr "`velocity_marker_size`（float/`36`）：有效端点的绘图标记大小。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1290
msgid ""
"`velocity_marker_edge_color` (str/`black`): Edge color of the endpoint "
"markers."
msgstr "`velocity_marker_edge_color`（str/`black`）：端点标记的边缘颜色。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1291
msgid ""
"`velocity_marker_edge_width` (float/`0.6`): Edge width of the endpoint "
"markers."
msgstr "`velocity_marker_edge_width`（float/`0.6`）：端点标记的边缘宽度。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1292
msgid ""
"`zero_velocity_color` (str/`cyan`): Plot color used for near-zero radial "
"velocity."
msgstr "`zero_velocity_color`（str/`cyan`）：用于接近零径向速度的绘图颜色。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1293
msgid ""
"`positive_velocity_color` (str/`crimson`): Plot color used for positive "
"radial velocity."
msgstr "`positive_velocity_color`（str/`crimson`）：用于正径向速度的绘图颜色。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1294
msgid ""
"`negative_velocity_color` (str/`royalblue`): Plot color used for negative"
" radial velocity."
msgstr "`negative_velocity_color`（str/`royalblue`）：用于负径向速度的绘图颜色。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1295
msgid "`no_hit_color` (str/`lightgray`): Plot color used for invalid beams."
msgstr "`no_hit_color`（str/`lightgray`）：用于无效波束的绘图颜色。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1297
msgid ""
"The scan output adds `radial_velocity` and `valid` arrays on top of the "
"standard LiDAR angular metadata."
msgstr "扫描输出在标准激光雷达角度元数据的基础上，增加了 `radial_velocity` 和 `valid` 数组。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1315
msgid ""
"**`fov`** and **`fov_radius`**:   Define the field of view (FOV) for the "
"object's sensors. The FOV is the angular range within which the sensor "
"can detect objects. The `fov` parameter specifies the angular range in "
"radians, while `fov_radius` sets the maximum detection distance."
msgstr ""
"**`fov`** 和 **`fov_radius`**：定义对象传感器的视场（FOV）。FOV 是传感器可检测对象的角度范围。`fov` "
"参数以弧度指定角度范围，`fov_radius` 设置最大检测距离。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md
msgid "**object mode**"
msgstr "**object 模式**"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1330
msgid "**`arrive_mode`**: Goal detection (`position`, `state`)"
msgstr "**`arrive_mode`** — 目标判定方式（`position`、`state`）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1331
msgid "**`unobstructed`**: Ignore collisions (`True`/`False`)"
msgstr "**`unobstructed`** — 忽略碰撞（`True`/`False`）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1335
msgid "**`arrive_mode`** (`str`, default: `'position'`)"
msgstr "**`arrive_mode`**（`str`，默认 `'position'`）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1336
msgid "Chooses the method for determining if the object has arrived at its goal:"
msgstr "选择判定对象是否到达目标的方法："

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1339
msgid ""
"`'position'`: Arrival is based solely on proximity to the goal position "
"(`[x, y]`)."
msgstr "`'position'`：仅根据与目标位置 (`[x, y]`) 的距离判断。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1340
msgid ""
"`'state'`: Considers both position and orientation in the arrival check "
"(`[x, y, theta]`)."
msgstr "`'state'`：同时考虑位置与朝向 (`[x, y, theta]`)。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1348
msgid "**`unobstructed`** (`bool`, default: `False`)"
msgstr "**`unobstructed`**（`bool`，默认 `False`）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1349
msgid ""
"When set to `True`, this object is treated as having an unobstructed "
"path, ignoring collisions with other objects and obstacles. This can be "
"useful for testing or for objects that must not be impeded."
msgstr "当设为 `True` 时，该对象被视为无障碍，忽略与其他对象和障碍物的碰撞，适合测试或需要不被阻挡的对象。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md
msgid "**object visualization**"
msgstr "**object 可视化**"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1362
msgid "**`color`**: Object color (`'r'`, `'blue'`, `'k'`)"
msgstr "**`color`** — 对象颜色（`'r'`、`'blue'`、`'k'` 等）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1363
msgid "**`description`**: Image file (`'car_blue.png'`, `'diff_robot0.png'`)"
msgstr "**`description`** — 图像文件（如 `'car_blue.png'`、`'diff_robot0.png'`）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1364
msgid "**`plot`**: Advanced display options"
msgstr "**`plot`** — 进阶显示选项"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1365
msgid "**Object**: Appearance (`obj_color`, `obj_alpha`, `obj_linestyle`)"
msgstr "**Object** — 外观（`obj_color`、`obj_alpha`、`obj_linestyle`）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1366
msgid "**Goal**: Goal markers (`show_goal`, `goal_color`, `show_goal_text`)"
msgstr "**Goal** — 目标标记（`show_goal`、`goal_color`、`show_goal_text`）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1367
msgid "**Trail**: Object trails (`show_trail`, `keep_trail_length`)"
msgstr "**Trail** — 轨迹点（`show_trail`、`keep_trail_length`）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1368
msgid "**Trajectory**: Path lines (`show_trajectory`, `keep_traj_length`)"
msgstr "**Trajectory** — 路径线（`show_trajectory`、`keep_traj_length`）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1369
msgid "**Sensors**: Sensor display (`show_sensor`, `show_fov`)"
msgstr "**Sensors** — 传感器显示（`show_sensor`、`show_fov`）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1373
msgid "**`color`** (`str`, default: inferred from role and kinematics)"
msgstr "**`color`**（`str`，默认从角色和运动学推断）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1374
msgid ""
"Specifies the object's color in visualizations for easy identification. "
"Robots with registered kinematics use the color defined by the kinematics"
" handler; obstacles default to black. Detailed color options can be found"
" in [matplotlib "
"color](https://matplotlib.org/stable/gallery/color/named_colors.html)."
msgstr ""
"指定对象在可视化中的颜色，便于识别。带有已注册运动学的机器人使用运动学处理器定义的颜色；障碍物默认使用黑色。详细颜色选项见 [matplotlib"
" color](https://matplotlib.org/stable/gallery/color/named_colors.html)。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1382
msgid "**`description`** (`str`, default: `None`)"
msgstr "**`description`**（`str`，默认 `None`）"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1383
msgid ""
"Provides an image for representing the object graphically. Supports image"
" files located in world/description. You can also set the absolute path "
"of the image file by your need."
msgstr "提供用于图形展示的图像，可使用 world/description 下的文件，或自定义绝对路径。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1385
msgid "**Available Images:**"
msgstr "**可用图像：**"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1386
msgid "`car_green.png`: A default image for the ackermann steering vehicle."
msgstr "`car_green.png`：阿克曼车辆默认图。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1387
msgid "`car_blue.png`"
msgstr "`car_blue.png`"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1388
msgid "`car_red.png`"
msgstr "`car_red.png`"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1389
msgid "`diff_robot0.png`"
msgstr "`diff_robot0.png`"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1390
msgid "`diff_robot1.png`"
msgstr "`diff_robot1.png`"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1398
msgid ""
"**`plot`**:   Contains plotting options controlling the visual "
"representation of the object. All plot elements are initially created at "
"the origin and positioned using transforms and data updates during "
"animation updates."
msgstr "**`plot`**：包含控制对象显示的绘图选项。所有绘图元素初始创建在原点，并在动画更新时通过变换与数据更新定位。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1401
msgid "**Object Visualization Properties:**"
msgstr "**对象可视化属性：**"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1402
msgid ""
"`obj_linestyle` (str/`'-'`): Line style for object outline (e.g., '-', "
"'--', ':', '-.')."
msgstr "`obj_linestyle`（str）：对象轮廓线型（如 '-', '--', ':', '-.'），默认 '-'."

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1403
msgid ""
"`obj_zorder` (int): Z-order (drawing layer) for object elements. Default "
"is 3 for robot patches, 1 for obstacle patches, and 2 for description "
"images."
msgstr "`obj_zorder`（int）：对象元素的绘制层级。机器人图形默认 3，障碍物图形默认 1，描述图片默认 2。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1404
msgid ""
"`obj_color` (str): Color of the object. Default is the object's color "
"property."
msgstr "`obj_color`（str）：对象颜色，默认沿用 `color`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1405
msgid "`obj_alpha` (float/`1.0`): Transparency of the object (0.0 to 1.0)."
msgstr "`obj_alpha`（float）：对象透明度（0.0-1.0），默认 1.0。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1406
msgid ""
"`obj_linewidth` (float/`1.0`): Width of the object outline in Matplotlib "
"points."
msgstr "`obj_linewidth`（float/`1.0`）：对象轮廓线宽，单位为 Matplotlib 点。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1408
msgid "**Goal Visualization:**"
msgstr "**目标可视化：**"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1409
msgid "`show_goal` (bool/`False`): Whether to show the goal position."
msgstr "`show_goal`（bool）：是否显示目标位置，默认 False。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1410
msgid ""
"`goal_color` (str): Color of the goal marker. Default is the object's "
"color."
msgstr "`goal_color`（str）：目标标记颜色，默认与对象一致。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1411
msgid "`goal_alpha` (float/`0.5`): Transparency of the goal marker (0.0 to 1.0)."
msgstr "`goal_alpha`（float）：目标透明度，默认 0.5。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1412
msgid "`goal_zorder` (int/`1`): Z-order of the goal marker."
msgstr "`goal_zorder`（int）：目标层级，默认 1。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1413
msgid "`show_goal_text` (bool/`False`): Whether to show the goal text."
msgstr "`show_goal_text`（bool）：是否显示目标位置的文本，默认 False。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1415
msgid "**Text Label Visualization:**"
msgstr "**文本标签可视化：**"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1416
msgid ""
"`show_text` (bool/`False`): Whether to show text information. By default,"
" the object's abbreviation (e.g., `r0`, `o1`) is displayed. Custom text "
"can be set at runtime via `object.set_text(\"custom label\")`. Pass "
"`None` to reset to the default abbreviation."
msgstr ""
"`show_text`（bool）：是否显示文本信息，默认 False。默认显示对象缩写（如 `r0`、`o1`）。可在运行时通过 "
"`object.set_text(\"自定义文本\")` 设置自定义文本。传入 `None` 可重置为默认缩写。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1417
msgid "`text_color` (str): Color of the text. Default is 'k' (black)."
msgstr "`text_color`（str）：文本颜色，默认 'k'（黑）。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1418
msgid "`text_size` (int/`10`): Font size of the text."
msgstr "`text_size`（int）：字体大小，默认 10。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1419
msgid "`text_alpha` (float/`1.0`): Transparency of the text (0.0 to 1.0)."
msgstr "`text_alpha`（float）：文本透明度，默认 1.0。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1420
msgid "`text_zorder` (int/`2`): Z-order of the text."
msgstr "`text_zorder`（int）：文本层级，默认 2。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1421
msgid ""
"`text_position` (list/`[-radius-0.1, radius+0.1]`): Position offset from "
"object center [dx, dy]."
msgstr "`text_position`（列表）：相对对象中心的偏移 `[dx, dy]`，默认 `[-radius-0.1, radius+0.1]`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1423
msgid ""
"Similarly, goal text can be customized via `object.set_goal_text(\"custom"
" goal label\")`."
msgstr "同样，目标文本可通过 `object.set_goal_text(\"自定义目标文本\")` 进行自定义。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1425
msgid "**Velocity Arrow Visualization:**"
msgstr "**速度箭头可视化：**"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1426
msgid "`show_arrow` (bool/`False`): Whether to show the velocity arrow."
msgstr "`show_arrow`（bool）：是否显示速度箭头，默认 False。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1427
msgid "`arrow_color` (str/`\"gold\"`): Color of the arrow."
msgstr "`arrow_color`（str）：箭头颜色，默认 \"gold\"。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1428
msgid "`arrow_length` (float/`0.4`): Length of the arrow."
msgstr "`arrow_length`（float）：箭头长度，默认 0.4。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1429
msgid "`arrow_width` (float/`0.6`): Width of the arrow."
msgstr "`arrow_width`（float）：箭头宽度，默认 0.6。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1430
msgid "`arrow_alpha` (float/`1.0`): Transparency of the arrow (0.0 to 1.0)."
msgstr "`arrow_alpha`（float）：箭头透明度，默认 1.0。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1431
msgid "`arrow_zorder` (int/`3`): Z-order of the arrow."
msgstr "`arrow_zorder`（int/`3`）：箭头的绘制层级。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1433
msgid "**Trajectory Path Visualization:**"
msgstr "**轨迹线可视化：**"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1434
msgid "`show_trajectory` (bool/`False`): Whether to show the trajectory line."
msgstr "`show_trajectory`（bool）：是否显示路径线，默认 False。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1435
msgid ""
"`traj_color` (str): Color of the trajectory. Default is the object's "
"color."
msgstr "`traj_color`（str）：路径颜色，默认继承对象颜色。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1436
msgid ""
"`traj_style` (str): Line style of the trajectory (e.g., '-', '--', ':', "
"'-.'). Default is \"-\"."
msgstr "`traj_style`（str）：路径线型（如 '-', '--', ':', '-.'），默认 \"-\"。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1437
msgid ""
"`traj_width` (float/object width): Width of the trajectory line. Default "
"is the object's width."
msgstr "`traj_width`（float/对象宽度）：轨迹线宽，默认为对象宽度。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1438
msgid "`traj_alpha` (float/`0.5`): Transparency of the trajectory (0.0 to 1.0)."
msgstr "`traj_alpha`（float）：路径透明度，默认 0.5。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1439
msgid "`traj_zorder` (int/`0`): Z-order for trajectory elements."
msgstr "`traj_zorder`（int）：路径层级，默认 0。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1440
msgid ""
"`keep_traj_length` (int/`0`): Number of steps to keep from the end of "
"trajectory. Default is 0 (keep all steps)."
msgstr "`keep_traj_length`（int）：保留的尾段步数，默认 0（保留全部）。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1442
msgid "**Object Trail Visualization:**"
msgstr "**对象轨迹点可视化：**"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1443
msgid "`show_trail` (bool/`False`): Whether to show object trails."
msgstr "`show_trail`（bool）：是否显示轨迹点，默认 False。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1444
msgid "`trail_freq` (int/`2`): Frequency of trail display (every N steps)."
msgstr "`trail_freq`（int）：轨迹显示频率（每 N 步），默认 2。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1445
msgid "`trail_type` (str): Type of trail shape. Default is the object's shape."
msgstr "`trail_type`（str）：轨迹形状类型，默认与对象形状相同。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1446
msgid ""
"`trail_edgecolor` (str): Edge color of the trail. Default is the object's"
" color."
msgstr "`trail_edgecolor`（str）：轨迹边缘颜色，默认为对象颜色。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1447
msgid "`trail_linewidth` (float/`0.8`): Width of the trail outline."
msgstr "`trail_linewidth`（float）：轨迹线宽，默认 0.8。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1448
msgid "`trail_alpha` (float/`0.7`): Transparency of the trail (0.0 to 1.0)."
msgstr "`trail_alpha`（float）：轨迹透明度，默认 0.7。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1449
msgid "`trail_fill` (bool/`False`): Whether to fill the trail shape."
msgstr "`trail_fill`（bool）：是否填充轨迹形状，默认 False。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1450
msgid ""
"`trail_color` (str): Fill color of the trail. Default is the object's "
"color."
msgstr "`trail_color`（str）：轨迹填充色，默认为对象颜色。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1451
msgid "`trail_zorder` (int/`0`): Z-order for trail elements."
msgstr "`trail_zorder`（int）：轨迹层级，默认 0。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1452
msgid ""
"`keep_trail_length` (int/`0`): Number of steps to keep from the end of "
"trail. Default is 0 (keep all steps)."
msgstr "`keep_trail_length`（int）：保留的轨迹尾段步数，默认 0（保留全部）。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1454
msgid "**Sensor Visualization:**"
msgstr "**传感器可视化：**"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1455
msgid "`show_sensor` (bool/`True`): Whether to show sensor visualizations."
msgstr "`show_sensor`（bool）：是否显示传感器，默认 True。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1457
msgid "**Field of View Visualization:**"
msgstr "**视场可视化：**"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1458
msgid "`show_fov` (bool/`False`): Whether to show field of view visualization."
msgstr "`show_fov`（bool）：是否显示视场，默认 False。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1459
msgid "`fov_color` (str/`\"lightblue\"`): Fill color of the field of view."
msgstr "`fov_color`（str）：视场填充色，默认 \"lightblue\"。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1460
msgid "`fov_edge_color` (str/`\"blue\"`): Edge color of the field of view."
msgstr "`fov_edge_color`（str）：视场边缘色，默认 \"blue\"。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1461
msgid "`fov_alpha` (float/`0.5`): Transparency of the field of view (0.0 to 1.0)."
msgstr "`fov_alpha`（float）：视场透明度，默认 0.5。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1462
msgid "`fov_zorder` (int/`1`): Z-order of the field of view."
msgstr "`fov_zorder`（int）：视场层级，默认 1。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1464
msgid ""
"**Note:** All visual elements are created at the origin during "
"initialization and positioned using matplotlib transforms (for patches) "
"and set_data methods (for lines) during animation updates."
msgstr "**注意：** 所有可视化元素在初始化时创建于原点，并在动画期间通过 matplotlib 的变换（patch）与 set_data（线）定位。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1528
msgid "GUI Configuration"
msgstr "GUI 配置"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1531
msgid "GUI Parameters Table"
msgstr "GUI 参数表"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1360
msgid "`keyboard`"
msgstr "`keyboard`"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1360
msgid "Keyboard control options (effective when `world.control_mode: keyboard`)."
msgstr "键盘控制选项（当 `world.control_mode: keyboard` 时生效）。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1360
msgid "`mouse`"
msgstr "`mouse`"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1360
msgid "Mouse control options."
msgstr "鼠标控制选项。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md
msgid "**keyboard properties**"
msgstr "**键盘控制**"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1542
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**`keyboard`** (`dict`, default: `{}`) Configure keyboard control. "
"Options are read by `KeyboardControl`. The default backend is `pynput`. "
"If `pynput` is unavailable, IR‑SIM automatically falls back to the "
"Matplotlib backend."
msgstr ""
"**`keyboard`**（`dict`，默认值：`{}`）配置键盘控制。选项由 `KeyboardControl` 读取。默认后端为 "
"`pynput`。若 `pynput` 不可用，IR‑SIM 会自动回退到 Matplotlib 后端。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1545
msgid "`backend` (`str`/`\"pynput\"`): Keyboard backend."
msgstr "`backend`（`str`）：键盘后端。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1546
msgid ""
"`\"pynput\"`: Global keyboard hook, but works when the Matplotlib window "
"is focused (requires the `pynput` package)."
msgstr "`\"pynput\"`（默认）：全局键盘hook，但需 Matplotlib 窗口聚焦（依赖 `pynput` 包）。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1547
msgid ""
"`\"mpl\"`: Matplotlib figure key events works when the figure window is "
"focused. (no extra dependency, but may be delayed when there are lots of "
"objects)."
msgstr "`\"mpl\"`：Matplotlib 图窗按键事件，仅在窗口聚焦时生效；无额外依赖，但对象数量多时可能有延迟。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1548
msgid ""
