#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1635
msgid "Custom Configuration"
msgstr "自定义配置"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1638
msgid "Custom Parameters"
msgstr "自定义参数"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1640
msgid ""
"`custom` is read from the YAML and handed back untouched. IR-SIM never "
"interprets it, so a scenario can carry the values its own code needs - "
"tolerances, planner weights, anything - beside the ones the simulator "
"reads, and both are edited in the same file."
msgstr ""
"`custom` 会从 YAML 中读取并原样返回。IR-SIM "
"不会解析其内容，因此场景可以把自己代码所需的数值（容差、规划器权重等）与仿真器读取的参数放在同一个文件中，一并修改。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1657
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Read it through {py:attr}`~irsim.env.env_base.EnvBase.config`, which "
"returns every parsed section, so a value defined next to the robot radius"
" is available without opening the file again:"
msgstr ""
"通过 {py:attr}`~irsim.env.env_base.EnvBase.config` "
"读取，它返回全部已解析的配置段，因此与机器人半径写在一起的数值无需再次打开文件即可获得："

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1667
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Nothing inside `custom` is validated, nesting is free, and the section "
"defaults to `{}` when the scenario omits it. `env.reload()` re-reads it "
"with the rest of the file."
msgstr "`custom` 内部不做任何校验，可以自由嵌套；场景未提供该段时默认为 `{}`。`env.reload()` 会连同文件其余部分一起重新读取。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1669
msgid "Configuration Examples"
msgstr "配置示例"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1671
msgid ""
"Let's explore various configuration examples to demonstrate the "
"flexibility and power of IR-SIM:"
msgstr "下面通过多个配置示例展示 IR-SIM 的灵活性与能力："

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md
msgid "Multi-Robot RVO"
msgstr "多机器人 RVO"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md
msgid "Multi-Robot ORCA"
msgstr "多机器人ORCA"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md
msgid "Mixed Obstacles"
msgstr "混合障碍"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md
msgid "Ackermann Vehicle"
msgstr "阿克曼车辆"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md
msgid "Omni Angular Robot"
msgstr "全向角速度机器人"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md
msgid "Sensor Integration"
msgstr "传感器集成"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1801
msgid "**Configuration Best Practices:**"
msgstr "**配置最佳实践：**"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1803
msgid ""
"**Multiple Objects**: When configuring multiple objects, use the `number`"
" and `distribution` parameters to efficiently generate them. For "
"instance, setting `number: 10` with a `distribution` of `'random'` can "
"quickly populate the simulation with randomly placed objects."
msgstr ""
"**多个对象**：配置多个对象时，使用 `number` 和 `distribution` 参数可高效地生成它们。例如，设置 `number: "
"10` 并使用 `'random'` 的 `distribution`，可快速在仿真中随机放置大量对象。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1804
msgid ""
"**Dictionary Parameters**: All dictionary-type parameters (e.g., "
"`distribution`, `shape`, `kinematics`, `behavior`) must include a "
"`'name'` key to specify their type. Omitting the `'name'` key will result"
" in default values or errors."
msgstr ""
"**字典参数**：所有字典类型的参数（如 `distribution`、`shape`、`kinematics`、`behavior`）都必须包含"
" `'name'` 键以指定其类型。省略 `'name'` 键会导致使用默认值或报错。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1805
msgid ""
"**Group Configurations**: By default, objects within the same group share"
" configurations. To customize individual objects within a group, add sub-"
"parameters using `-`. Unspecified objects will inherit the last defined "
"configuration within the group."
msgstr "**分组配置**：同组对象默认共享配置。若需定制，请使用 `-` 添加子参数；未显式配置的对象会继承组内最后一个配置。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1806
msgid ""
"**Kinematics and Velocities**: Ensure that the `velocity` and `vel_max` "
"parameters match the kinematics model. For example, a differential drive "
"robot (`'diff'`) uses `[v, omega]`, an omnidirectional robot (`'omni'`) "
"uses body-frame `[forward, lateral]`, and `'omni_angular'` uses "
"`[forward, lateral, yaw_rate]`."
msgstr ""
"**运动学与速度**：确保 `velocity` 与 `vel_max` 的格式与运动学模型匹配，例如差速 (`'diff'`) 使用 `[v, "
"omega]`，全向 (`'omni'`) 使用机体坐标系 `[forward, lateral]`，`'omni_angular'` 使用 "
"`[forward, lateral, yaw_rate]`。"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/han/tech/ir-sim/docs/source/yaml_config/configuration.md:1807
msgid ""
"**Plotting Options**: Customize the visualization of your simulation "
"through the `plot` parameter for each object if the `plot` section is "
"located in the object configuration. If it is located in the root of the "
"object configuration, it will be applied to all objects."
msgstr "**绘图选项**：若 `plot` 位于对象配置内部，可为单个对象定制可视化；若位于对象配置的根级，则应用于所有对象。"

#~ msgid "**`kinematics`** (`dict`, default: `None`)"
#~ msgstr "**`kinematics`**（`dict`，默认 `None`）"

#~ msgid "Sets the kinematic model governing the object's movement."
#~ msgstr "设置控制对象运动的运动学模型。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`'diff'`: Differential drive robot, suitable"
#~ " for robots that can rotate in "
#~ "place (e.g., two-wheel robots). This "
#~ "type of robot is controlled by "
#~ "linear and angular velocity. Optional "
#~ "parameters:"
#~ msgstr "`'diff'`：差速驱动机器人，适用于原地旋转的机器人（如两轮机器人）。通过线速度和角速度控制。可选参数："

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`noise` (bool): whether to add noise "
#~ "to the velocity commands. Default is "
#~ "`False`."
#~ msgstr "`noise`（bool）：是否给速度命令添加噪声。默认为 `False`。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`alpha` (list): noise parameters for "
#~ "velocity commands. Default is `[0.03, 0,"
#~ " 0, 0.03]`."
#~ msgstr "`alpha`（列表）：速度命令的噪声参数。默认值为 `[0.03, 0, 0, 0.03]`。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`'omni'`: Omnidirectional movement, allowing "
#~ "movement in any direction without "
#~ "changing orientation. This type of robot"
#~ " is controlled by body-frame "
#~ "velocities `[forward, lateral]`. Orientation "
#~ "(theta) is preserved but not updated."
#~ " Optional parameters:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`'omni'`：全向运动，允许在任意方向移动而不改变朝向。此类机器人通过机体坐标系速度 `[forward, "
#~ "lateral]` 控制。朝向角（theta）保持不变。可选参数："

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`alpha` (list): noise parameters for "
#~ "velocity commands `[alpha_forward, alpha_lateral]`."
#~ " Default is `[0.03, 0.03]`."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`alpha`（列表）：速度命令的噪声参数 `[alpha_forward, "
#~ "alpha_lateral]`。默认值为 `[0.03, 0.03]`。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`'omni_angular'`: Omnidirectional movement with "
#~ "angular velocity control. Extends `omni` "
#~ "by adding a yaw rate channel that"
#~ " integrates orientation (theta). This type"
#~ " of robot is controlled by body-"
#~ "frame velocities `[forward, lateral, "
#~ "yaw_rate]`. Optional parameters:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`'omni_angular'`：带角速度控制的全向运动。在 `omni` "
#~ "基础上增加偏航角速度通道以积分朝向角（theta）。此类机器人通过机体坐标系速度 `[forward, "
#~ "lateral, yaw_rate]` 控制。可选参数："

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`alpha` (list): noise parameters for "
#~ "velocity commands `[alpha_forward, alpha_lateral,"
#~ " alpha_yaw]`. Default is `[0.03, 0.03, "
#~ "0.03]`."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`alpha`（列表）：速度命令的噪声参数 `[alpha_forward, alpha_lateral, "
#~ "alpha_yaw]`。默认值为 `[0.03, 0.03, 0.03]`。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`'acker'`: Ackermann steering, typical for "
#~ "car-like vehicles requiring a turning"
#~ " radius."
#~ msgstr "`'acker'`：阿克曼转向，典型用于类车辆，需要转向半径。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`mode` (str): steering mode, either "
#~ "`steer` or `angular`. Default is "
#~ "`steer`."
#~ msgstr "`mode`（str）：转向模式，为 `steer` 或 `angular`。默认为 `steer`。"

#~ msgid "`steer`: the object is controlled by linear and steer angle."
#~ msgstr "`steer`：对象通过线速度和转向角控制。"

#~ msgid "`angular`: the object is controlled by linear and angular velocity."
#~ msgstr "`angular`：对象通过线速度和角速度控制。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**`vel_min`** (`list` of `float`, default: "
#~ "`[-1, -1]`) and **`vel_max`** (`list` of"
#~ " `float`, default: `[1, 1]`)"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**`vel_min`**（`float` 列表，默认值：`[-1, -1]`）和 "
#~ "**`vel_max`**（`float` 列表，默认值：`[1, 1]`）"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Set the minimum and maximum velocity "
#~ "limits for each control dimension (e.g.,"
#~ " linear and angular velocities). These "
#~ "constraints ensure the object's motion "
#~ "stays within feasible and safe bounds."
#~ msgstr "设置每个控制维度的最小和最大速度限制（例如线速度和角速度）。这些约束确保对象的运动保持在可行且安全的范围内。"

#~ msgid "**`acce`** (`list` of `float`, default: `[inf, inf]`)"
#~ msgstr "**`acce`**（`float` 列表，默认值：`[inf, inf]`）"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Defines acceleration limits as the "
#~ "maximum change in velocity per time "
#~ "step for each control dimension. This"
#~ " parameter simulates the physical "
#~ "limitations of the object's motion "
#~ "capabilities."
#~ msgstr "定义加速度限制，即每个控制维度在每个时间步内的最大速度变化。此参数模拟对象运动能力的物理限制。"

#~ msgid "**`angle_range`** (`list` of `float`, default: `[-pi, pi]`)"
#~ msgstr "**`angle_range`**（`float` 列表，默认：`[-pi, pi]`）"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Specifies the allowed range of "
#~ "orientation angles `[min, max]` in "
#~ "radians. The object's orientation angle "
#~ "`theta` is wrapped within this range "
#~ "to maintain consistency."
#~ msgstr "指定允许的朝向角范围 `[min, max]`（弧度）。对象的朝向角 `theta` 会被归整到此范围内以保持一致性。"

#~ msgid "**`goal_threshold`** (`float`, default: `0.1`)"
#~ msgstr "**`goal_threshold`**（`float`，默认：`0.1`）"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Determines the proximity threshold to "
#~ "the goal at which the object is"
#~ " considered to have arrived. Once "
#~ "within this distance, arrival behaviors "
#~ "or state changes may be triggered."
#~ msgstr "确定对象被认为已到达目标的距离阈值。一旦在此距离范围内，可能会触发到达行为或状态变化。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Any other key under `kinematics` is "
#~ "passed to the handler's constructor. "
#~ "This is how a model registered "
#~ "with `@register_kinematics` receives its own"
#~ " parameters, e.g. `kinematics: {name: "
#~ "'lag', tau: 0.5}`."
#~ msgstr ""
